  csobState: CsobPaymentState

  comgateState: ComgatePaymentState

  created: Datetime!

  statePeriod: DatetimeRange!

  """
  The amount of money that has actually been deducted from the customer's account.
  When the payment is authorized but not yet deducted, this will be null.
  When the payment is fully deducted, this will be equal to the total amount deducted.

  The amount deducted may be lower that the total price of the order in the case that the order could be only partially
  served, or if we are deducting the expired order penalty.
